 spectral_norm's mixed operands)."] [234 1 "// tpName is a type's tp_name: a built-in type of another module than builtins named with it."] [242 1 "// seqConcatError is PyNumber_Add's sequence fallback when neither operand adds: str's, list's and tuple's sq_concat"] [243 1 "// and the bytes-like buffers' refuse b in their own words (nil for any other a)."] [262 1 "// overridesReflected is b's type a proper subtype of a's whose reflected method is its own."] [272 1 "// binRDunders are the reflected methods' names, __radd__ ..., made once (queue 305: binaryOp1 made one per call)."] [306 1 "// InPlaceOp is a op= b: the in-place method, else BinaryOp."] [309 17 "// int and float have no in-place methods"] [332 1 "// UnaryOp is +o, -o or ~o."] [343 1 "// RichCompare is a op b (PyObject_RichCompare: the C level's recursion check, then do_richcompare)."] [345 2 "// two exact ints or two exact floats: their own comparison, which recurses into nothing (202b)"] [365 1 "// doRichCompare is do_richcompare: b's swapped method first when b's type is a proper subtype of a's (whether or not"] [366 1 "// it overrides it), then a's method, then b's swapped one unless already tried (checked_reverse_op), then identity for"] [367 1 "// == and != (queue 264: test_binop's test_comparison_orders)."] [399 1 "// Eq is a == b as a Go bool (identity first, as PyObject_RichCompareBool)."] [411 1 "// GetAttr is getattr(o, name)."] [426 1 "// Call is f(*args) with the last len(kwnames) of args keyword arguments."] [435 1 "// GetIter is iter(o)."] [446 1 "// mappingOnly is an object whose subscription is mp_subscript alone, no sq_item for PySequence_Check: a union, a class"] [447 1 "// whose metaclass defines no __getitem__ (type's GetItem slot is the class subscription; queue 225: iter(int))."] [459 1 "// Next is next(it): (nil, nil) at the end."] [468 1 "// GetItem is o[key]."] [470 2 "// an exact list's or tuple's item at an int in range: the slot's answer without its conversions (202b)"] [501 